WEBVTT

00:00:03.197 --> 00:00:04.225
Now a P.D.F.

00:00:04.225 --> 00:00:05.708
report with a chart.

00:00:05.708 --> 00:00:08.333
The sales numbers are only in the chart.

00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:13.012
The chart has a caption, Figure one, which is how the site knows it matters.

00:00:13.012 --> 00:00:14.667
Attach it the same way.

00:00:15.119 --> 00:00:15.863
Ask:

00:00:15.863 --> 00:00:18.839
which quarter sold the most units?

00:00:19.289 --> 00:00:22.342
The assistant read the chart, and answers from it:

00:00:22.342 --> 00:00:23.651
the third quarter.

00:00:23.651 --> 00:00:28.012
Describing a figure takes a little longer, which is why an attachment with

00:00:28.012 --> 00:00:29.919
figures is slower to prepare.

